      "severity": "fail"
    },
    {
      "detail": "SKIP_EDITABLE_GUARD=1 is a documented unvalidated bypass.",
      "finding": "Explicit bypass",
      "severity": "fail"
    },
    {
      "detail": "PR 324 adds a script and library but no deployment, pip integration, unit integration, launcher integration, or pip policy hook.",
      "finding": "Not installed or integrated",
      "severity": "fail"
    },
    {
      "detail": "The wrapper delegates with /usr/bin/env pip. If installed at the first pip on PATH as documented, this resolves the wrapper again.",
      "finding": "Wrapper recursion risk",
      "severity": "fail"
    },
    {
      "detail": "The Python library recognizes only ~/.skenv. It does not recognize the service venvs for SKHarness, SKVoice, or Liberty.",
      "finding": "Runtime coverage",
      "severity": "fail"
    },
    {
      "detail": "The Python helper allows an interpreter outside SHARED_INTERPRETERS, but this helper is not wired into pip and therefore does not enforce that distinction.",
